WEBVTT

01:35.920 --> 01:40.630
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.710 --> 01:44.039
[Episode 38]

01:44.590 --> 01:45.520
Did you kill her?

01:45.920 --> 01:46.509
Mother,

01:47.120 --> 01:47.590
we've

01:48.050 --> 01:48.800
killed her.

01:50.590 --> 01:51.039
Good.

01:52.039 --> 01:52.970
Very good.

01:54.560 --> 01:55.440
Prince of Zhennan,

01:55.440 --> 01:57.300
you really didn't disappoint me.

01:57.840 --> 01:59.039
I've never forgotten

01:59.400 --> 02:00.950
your kindness,

02:01.280 --> 02:02.510
and I dare not slack

02:03.000 --> 02:04.730
in meeting your expectations.

02:05.040 --> 02:06.230
It is my honor

02:06.600 --> 02:08.060
to help ease your burdens.

02:09.000 --> 02:09.860
Good boy.

02:10.520 --> 02:12.120
I know your filial devotion.

02:12.170 --> 02:12.590
Hurry.

02:13.080 --> 02:13.940
Rise and speak.

02:14.680 --> 02:15.740
Thank you, Mother.

02:21.910 --> 02:22.590
Bring it in.

02:34.940 --> 02:35.700
Mother,

02:36.520 --> 02:37.520
I have brought her

02:37.940 --> 02:39.470
back to you.

02:43.120 --> 02:43.870
You wretch,

02:45.150 --> 02:47.190
your miserable state today

02:47.450 --> 02:49.670
is what you get for opposing me.

02:52.190 --> 02:53.000
Open it.

02:53.850 --> 02:55.320
Let me see.

03:27.190 --> 03:27.960
Jingyan!

03:28.540 --> 03:29.120
Jingyan!

03:29.680 --> 03:30.430
Jingyan!

03:30.970 --> 03:31.820
Jingyan!

03:32.000 --> 03:33.800
What's wrong with you, Jingyan?

03:34.480 --> 03:35.300
Wake up.

03:37.030 --> 03:38.360
Jingyan, wake up!

03:39.150 --> 03:39.800
Jingyan!

03:44.120 --> 03:44.680
Jingyan!

03:44.680 --> 03:45.430
Mother,

03:46.010 --> 03:47.490
are you satisfied

03:47.730 --> 03:49.130
with my filial devotion?

03:51.680 --> 03:52.520
His Majesty...

03:52.520 --> 03:53.650
His Majesty is dead!

03:54.030 --> 03:56.400
His Majesty has passed away!

04:03.050 --> 04:03.640
Jingyan!

04:07.540 --> 04:08.610
It was you.

04:09.450 --> 04:10.720
Xia Jingshi!

04:13.590 --> 04:14.430
Kill him.

04:14.870 --> 04:16.110
Kill him!

04:20.310 --> 04:24.600
Kill!

04:30.750 --> 04:31.240
You...

04:31.630 --> 04:33.190
You're committing treason!

04:33.190 --> 04:34.220
You dog!

04:34.600 --> 04:36.130
I have long wanted you dead!

04:39.120 --> 04:40.440
Heaven shows no mercy,

04:40.600 --> 04:42.000
and darkness draws near.

04:42.120 --> 04:43.360
Only you

04:43.510 --> 04:45.040
can save all living beings.

04:46.920 --> 04:47.390
You...

04:48.680 --> 04:49.270
You...

04:50.510 --> 04:51.270
Protect me!

04:51.540 --> 04:52.360
Guards!

04:52.670 --> 04:53.840
Protect me!

05:05.760 --> 05:07.630
The Jinxiu Royal Guards' Whistling Flare?

05:07.630 --> 05:08.190
They only use it

05:08.190 --> 05:09.680
in dire emergencies.

05:09.830 --> 05:12.560
It must be Xia Jingshi
causing trouble over there.

05:12.560 --> 05:13.110
Let's go.

05:16.360 --> 05:17.040
Protect me.

05:17.600 --> 05:18.310
Guards!

05:19.070 --> 05:19.830
Guards!

05:20.850 --> 05:21.750
Protect me!

05:22.750 --> 05:23.480
Guards!

05:23.480 --> 05:24.260
Mother,

05:24.630 --> 05:26.120
isn't it enough that I'm here

05:26.120 --> 05:26.980
to protect you?

05:28.530 --> 05:29.530
Xia Jingshi,

05:29.680 --> 05:30.840
I'll kill you!

05:30.870 --> 05:32.570
Why are you so angry, Mother?

05:32.870 --> 05:33.480
Isn't this

05:33.480 --> 05:34.580
what you want?

05:34.830 --> 05:35.680
Xia Jingshi,

05:36.240 --> 05:37.430
you heartless,

05:37.510 --> 05:39.190
ungrateful traitor.

05:39.360 --> 05:41.080
I treated you as my own,

05:41.150 --> 05:42.800
yet you repaid kindness with betrayal!

05:42.800 --> 05:44.000
Give me back my Jingyan.

05:44.000 --> 05:45.060
Give me back my Jingyan!

05:45.060 --> 05:46.940
You treated me as your own?

05:47.120 --> 05:47.920
Would you

05:47.920 --> 05:49.070
feed poison

05:49.070 --> 05:50.140
to your own child?

05:50.390 --> 05:52.000
Xia Jingshi, have you forgotten?

05:52.000 --> 05:53.800
You're only alive because I give you

05:53.800 --> 05:55.260
the antidote every month.

05:55.270 --> 05:56.130
Are you insane?

05:56.270 --> 05:57.690
How dare you hold a grudge against me?

05:57.690 --> 05:59.630
Should I be grateful instead?

06:00.040 --> 06:00.950
Do you know how long I've waited

06:00.950 --> 06:01.900
for this day?

06:02.000 --> 06:03.240
Do you know

06:03.240 --> 06:04.190
how long I've waited

06:04.190 --> 06:05.120
to see you crawl at my feet,

06:05.120 --> 06:06.300
begging for mercy?

06:06.600 --> 06:07.970
Cry. Scream.

06:08.070 --> 06:08.830
If you don't cry or scream,

06:08.830 --> 06:10.230
how can I feel satisfied?

06:10.510 --> 06:12.270
Xia Jingshi, you're heartless.

06:12.270 --> 06:13.730
Everyone wanted you dead,

06:13.870 --> 06:15.400
but I spared your life.

06:15.510 --> 06:16.750
You're insane.

06:17.270 --> 06:19.040
I should've killed you long ago!

06:19.040 --> 06:19.800
Otherwise,

06:19.800 --> 06:20.820
my Jingyan wouldn't have died.

06:20.820 --> 06:21.270
Mother,

06:21.270 --> 06:22.800
that's quite unfair.

06:23.240 --> 06:24.730
I once swore

06:24.790 --> 06:26.350
that one day

06:26.560 --> 06:28.890
I would repay kindness and avenge hatred.

06:28.920 --> 06:29.830
Mother, I have never forgotten

06:29.830 --> 06:31.210
your kindness.

06:31.480 --> 06:32.190
Today,

06:37.570 --> 06:39.190
I'm here to repay it.

06:51.420 --> 06:52.000
Mother,

06:52.840 --> 06:53.190
do you know

06:53.190 --> 06:54.310
what I just fed you?

06:54.800 --> 06:55.310
It's a poison

06:55.310 --> 06:57.190
I prepared especially for you.

07:06.070 --> 07:07.190
Xia Jingshi,

07:07.720 --> 07:09.840
you vile, rotten bastard!

07:11.040 --> 07:11.870
After taking this poison,

07:11.870 --> 07:12.830
you'd better not get too agitated,

07:12.830 --> 07:14.270
or your blood will surge

07:14.500 --> 07:15.760
and flow faster.

07:16.480 --> 07:17.190
Mother,

07:17.710 --> 07:19.640
I don't want you to die too quickly.

07:20.430 --> 07:21.430
What do you want?

07:21.680 --> 07:22.510
What do I want?

07:22.830 --> 07:24.480
Back then, when you poisoned me,

07:24.480 --> 07:26.120
you didn't take my life right away.

07:26.120 --> 07:27.860
So now, to show my filial piety,

07:28.120 --> 07:28.750
I won't

07:28.750 --> 07:30.410
take yours right away either.

07:31.870 --> 07:33.240
You have 10 to 15 minutes.

07:33.240 --> 07:34.240
Within that time,

07:34.560 --> 07:35.360
the poison

07:35.380 --> 07:36.870
will spread through your entire body,

07:36.870 --> 07:37.600
gradually

07:37.600 --> 07:39.220
corroding your organs.

07:39.310 --> 07:40.909
Your heart, liver, and lungs

07:40.920 --> 07:42.430
will all dissolve into blood.

07:42.430 --> 07:43.000
You'll feel pain

07:43.000 --> 07:44.510
in every part of your body,

07:45.270 --> 07:48.290
unable to live or die as you wish.

07:52.750 --> 07:53.950
See how filial I am?

07:54.750 --> 07:56.680
You tormented me for so many years,

07:56.840 --> 07:58.070
but I'll torment you

07:58.630 --> 08:00.030
for just 10 to 15 minutes.

08:53.840 --> 08:54.700
Your Eminence!

09:15.480 --> 09:15.990
Your Highness,

09:15.990 --> 09:16.950
the Imperial Guards
have fired the Whistling Flare.

09:16.950 --> 09:19.610
Their reinforcements
could arrive any moment.

09:32.940 --> 09:34.200
Protect His Highness!

09:56.190 --> 09:57.120
Yixiao?

09:58.930 --> 09:59.870
Yixiao is here.

10:00.790 --> 10:01.360
Yixiao,

10:01.960 --> 10:03.120
you've come at the perfect time.

10:03.120 --> 10:04.080
This is the most important

10:04.080 --> 10:05.080
moment of my life.

10:05.360 --> 10:06.320
I'm glad

10:06.340 --> 10:07.570
you're here to witness it

10:07.570 --> 10:08.520
and be with me.

10:08.590 --> 10:09.790
How many more people

10:09.790 --> 10:10.670
must die

10:11.440 --> 10:12.620
for this so-called
important moment of yours?

10:12.620 --> 10:13.490
No, no.

10:14.390 --> 10:15.910
I think there's
a misunderstanding between us.

10:15.910 --> 10:17.120
Now that my great revenge
is finally complete,

10:17.120 --> 10:18.030
I can finally clear up

10:18.030 --> 10:19.200
all these misunderstandings with you.

10:19.200 --> 10:19.750
There's so much

10:19.750 --> 10:20.910
I want to say to you.

10:21.000 --> 10:21.930
There's no need.

10:22.350 --> 10:24.090
I only have one thing to say:

10:24.160 --> 10:27.560
those who commit too many evil deeds
will destroy themselves.

10:27.560 --> 10:28.420
What is "evil?"

10:29.070 --> 10:29.930
I rid Jinxiu

10:29.960 --> 10:31.260
of a tyrannical ruler.

10:31.470 --> 10:32.660
How is that evil?

10:33.080 --> 10:34.220
I endured years

10:34.320 --> 10:34.910
of pain and humiliation,

10:34.910 --> 10:36.550
and now I've paid it

10:36.670 --> 10:38.150
all back in full.

10:38.240 --> 10:39.450
How is that evil?

10:40.000 --> 10:41.910
As the eldest son
of Jinxiu's late emperor,

10:41.910 --> 10:42.550
I took back

10:42.550 --> 10:44.450
what was rightfully mine.

10:44.630 --> 10:45.980
How is that evil?

10:56.530 --> 10:57.790
Haven't you always wanted to know

10:57.790 --> 10:58.970
why I was poisoned?

10:59.480 --> 11:00.910
It was all thanks to her.

11:01.840 --> 11:03.560
To seize my throne,

11:03.720 --> 11:05.070
she poisoned me

11:05.150 --> 11:06.720
and drove me out of Shengjing.

11:06.720 --> 11:07.870
I hate her to the bone.

11:07.870 --> 11:08.630
But every month

11:08.630 --> 11:10.440
when I had to get the antidote,

11:10.600 --> 11:11.670
I had to beg her

11:11.670 --> 11:12.480
like a dog.

11:14.400 --> 11:15.280
What for?

11:16.320 --> 11:17.590
I just wanted to live.

11:17.960 --> 11:19.090
I wanted to survive!

11:22.790 --> 11:23.320
Yes.

11:24.280 --> 11:25.260
I know

11:25.840 --> 11:26.910
my hands are stained with

11:26.910 --> 11:28.920
the blood of countless innocent people.

11:28.920 --> 11:30.110
But I had no choice.

11:31.200 --> 11:32.330
This path I've taken

11:32.840 --> 11:33.630
is one I must walk through

11:33.630 --> 11:35.720
mountains of corpses and seas of blood.

11:35.720 --> 11:36.200
So,

11:36.870 --> 11:38.800
I don't care how many people I kill.

11:39.360 --> 11:40.150
Yixiao,

11:40.690 --> 11:42.420
now that I've told you all this,

11:42.870 --> 11:44.440
can you understand me?

11:45.660 --> 11:46.990
I didn't tell you before

11:47.280 --> 11:49.210
because I didn't want my suffering

11:49.610 --> 11:50.900
to become your pain.

11:51.210 --> 11:52.070
Your suffering

11:52.510 --> 11:54.040
has become your obsession.

11:54.390 --> 11:56.360
You believe that since you're in hell,

11:56.360 --> 11:57.030
everyone else should

11:57.030 --> 11:58.230
be dragged there too.

11:58.910 --> 11:59.910
But you don't know

12:00.150 --> 12:02.610
you've become a prisoner
of that obsession.

12:03.600 --> 12:04.720
Do you really want

12:04.720 --> 12:06.200
to make me your enemy?

12:06.270 --> 12:07.120
It seems you still

12:07.120 --> 12:08.750
have no intention of repenting.

12:08.750 --> 12:10.950
Then don't blame me for being ruthless.

12:14.910 --> 12:15.480
Your Highness,

12:15.480 --> 12:15.960
we're out of time!

12:15.960 --> 12:16.480
Yixiao,

12:17.030 --> 12:18.480
I don't believe you will kill me.

12:18.480 --> 12:20.450
I don't believe you actually will!

12:26.230 --> 12:28.360
-Yixiao...
-Your Highness, let's go!

12:53.650 --> 12:54.390
Let's hurry back

12:54.390 --> 12:55.920
and meet up with Feng Suige.

12:56.120 --> 12:56.630
Okay.

13:00.060 --> 13:01.010
Please rest assured.

13:01.010 --> 13:02.720
Her wounds have been treated.

13:02.990 --> 13:04.550
Her life will no longer be in danger.

13:04.550 --> 13:05.930
She just needs proper rest to recover.

13:05.930 --> 13:07.590
Thank you for your help.

13:08.600 --> 13:09.610
See the doctor out

13:09.810 --> 13:11.200
and reward him generously.

13:11.200 --> 13:11.660
Yes.

13:12.150 --> 13:13.210
I'll take my leave.

13:14.000 --> 13:14.460
Doctor,

13:14.630 --> 13:15.630
this way, please.

13:18.240 --> 13:19.960
When I just woke up,

13:21.440 --> 13:23.870
I heard your conversation with the doctor.

13:24.630 --> 13:25.910
He said the child in my womb

13:25.910 --> 13:27.120
was gone

13:28.270 --> 13:28.870
and that

13:28.870 --> 13:31.200
I'll never be able to have children again.

13:32.150 --> 13:33.680
Don't think about that now.

13:34.320 --> 13:35.650
Just focus on recovery.

13:36.510 --> 13:37.710
Don't worry, Xiyang.

13:38.600 --> 13:40.270
I will definitely tear Xia Jingshi

13:40.270 --> 13:41.480
to pieces.

13:42.670 --> 13:44.600
Whether Xia Jingshi lives or dies

13:45.720 --> 13:47.870
no longer matters to me,

13:48.910 --> 13:50.840
and not being able to have children

13:51.960 --> 13:53.290
doesn't matter either.

13:55.230 --> 13:57.240
♪ Flying alone ♪

13:57.600 --> 14:00.510
♪ With no need for direction ♪

13:57.910 --> 13:59.080
In this life,

14:00.480 --> 14:02.150
I once loved someone,

14:02.910 --> 14:05.130
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

14:04.150 --> 14:06.390
but he's dead to me now.

14:05.530 --> 14:08.050
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

14:07.320 --> 14:09.050
Then I met someone who loved me,

14:10.640 --> 14:12.420
♪ Roaming freely ♪

14:10.790 --> 14:12.150
and now he's dead too.

14:12.800 --> 14:15.780
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

14:14.030 --> 14:15.030
It's a pity

14:15.030 --> 14:16.600
I couldn't keep his child.

14:17.990 --> 14:19.830
♪ The wet wings ♪

14:20.220 --> 14:23.810
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

14:20.690 --> 14:21.540
Xiyang,

14:22.030 --> 14:22.960
tomorrow I'll have someone

14:22.960 --> 14:24.560
send you to Zhengnian Villa.

14:25.320 --> 14:26.200
With Young Mistress Ling there

14:26.200 --> 14:27.240
to look after you,

14:27.520 --> 14:31.110
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

14:28.440 --> 14:29.700
I'll feel more at ease.

14:30.150 --> 14:30.960
Brother,

14:32.520 --> 14:34.160
aren't you coming back with me?

14:33.440 --> 14:37.860
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

14:35.200 --> 14:35.600
I know

14:35.600 --> 14:37.800
you're determined to kill Xia Jingshi.

14:37.970 --> 14:38.720
Promise me,

14:38.720 --> 14:40.480
don't put yourself in danger.

14:42.000 --> 14:43.030
You're all I have left.

14:42.460 --> 14:45.960
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

14:43.720 --> 14:45.150
You must stay safe,

14:46.080 --> 14:46.720
alright?

14:47.240 --> 14:47.970
Don't worry.

14:48.560 --> 14:53.640
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

14:48.790 --> 14:50.200
I know what I'm doing.

14:55.770 --> 14:56.830
I'm sorry, Xiyang.

14:58.510 --> 15:00.120
I failed to protect you.

15:01.380 --> 15:02.510
But don't be afraid.

15:03.270 --> 15:04.330
As long as I'm here,

15:05.840 --> 15:07.200
all of this will pass.

15:15.630 --> 15:16.490
Your Highness,

15:16.550 --> 15:18.810
Miss Yixiao and her group have returned.

15:23.200 --> 15:24.400
Thank you. Thank you.

15:24.670 --> 15:25.200
You helped me

15:25.200 --> 15:26.300
get rid of that tyrant,

15:26.300 --> 15:29.100
which has finally lifted
the hatred from my heart.

15:31.790 --> 15:32.960
Do you really want

15:32.960 --> 15:34.410
to make me your enemy?

15:34.450 --> 15:35.390
It seems you still

15:35.390 --> 15:37.010
have no intention of repenting.

15:37.010 --> 15:38.450
Then don't blame me for being ruthless.

15:38.450 --> 15:39.120
I don't believe

15:39.120 --> 15:40.580
you will actually kill me!

15:52.750 --> 15:53.480
Please rise.

15:55.790 --> 15:58.030
Now that the Emperor
and Empress Dowager have been executed,

15:58.030 --> 16:00.080
Your Highness,
as the eldest son of the late emperor

16:00.080 --> 16:01.740
and an accomplished general,

16:02.050 --> 16:04.180
you are the only choice for the throne.

16:04.200 --> 16:05.620
When the His Highness ascends the throne,

16:05.620 --> 16:06.870
everything you've done

16:06.870 --> 16:07.870
will be rewarded.

16:09.950 --> 16:10.720
Your Highness,

16:10.720 --> 16:12.120
what are your plans next?

16:12.720 --> 16:14.600
You must have come to me
to entrust a matter to me.

16:14.600 --> 16:16.460
I am at your service
even at the cost of my life.

16:16.460 --> 16:17.100
Yes.

16:17.910 --> 16:19.370
We will leave Shengjing immediately

16:19.370 --> 16:20.840
and return to Pingling City.

16:20.840 --> 16:21.670
During this time,

16:21.670 --> 16:23.480
we need you to mediate in the court

16:23.480 --> 16:25.410
and help us win over the ministers.

16:26.140 --> 16:28.000
Shengjing is now without a leader

16:28.350 --> 16:30.770
and desperately needs you
to take control of the situation.

16:30.770 --> 16:32.370
You're leaving at this time?

16:32.720 --> 16:34.020
Do you think

16:34.490 --> 16:36.240
he will return to Pingling City?

16:36.240 --> 16:37.100
It's possible.

16:37.320 --> 16:38.990
The Emperor and Empress Dowager are dead.

16:38.990 --> 16:39.790
Only Xia Jingshi

16:39.790 --> 16:41.200
is qualified to succeed the throne.

16:41.200 --> 16:42.790
Once the news of their deaths

16:42.790 --> 16:43.480
spreads,

16:43.750 --> 16:45.800
Shengjing City
will surely fall into chaos.

16:45.800 --> 16:46.870
In the capital region,

16:46.870 --> 16:47.390
there are still

16:47.390 --> 16:48.770
some ministers who hold military power.

16:48.770 --> 16:51.220
They will surely harbor
treasonous thoughts.

16:51.220 --> 16:52.270
When he returns with his army

16:52.270 --> 16:53.440
to Shengjing,

16:53.790 --> 16:54.510
no one will be able

16:54.510 --> 16:56.440
to stop him from taking the throne.

16:57.460 --> 16:58.810
Then I will stay in Shengjing City

16:58.810 --> 17:00.210
waiting for your return.

17:00.360 --> 17:00.790
No.

17:02.600 --> 17:03.530
I'm not leaving.

17:04.920 --> 17:05.670
Your Highness,

17:05.670 --> 17:06.750
according to our plan,

17:06.750 --> 17:07.680
we should return to Pingling City

17:07.680 --> 17:08.750
after we succeed.

17:08.910 --> 17:10.569
Mr. Wang, you may leave us now.

17:11.160 --> 17:11.720
Yes.

17:17.450 --> 17:18.589
I'm staying here.

17:20.280 --> 17:20.920
I have

17:20.920 --> 17:22.720
something more important to do.

17:23.480 --> 17:24.410
I never imagined

17:24.960 --> 17:25.829
Xia Jingshi held

17:25.829 --> 17:27.359
so much hatred in his heart,

17:27.720 --> 17:29.720
and that he's carried it
for so many years.

17:29.720 --> 17:30.440
He is even more patient and enduring

17:30.440 --> 17:31.440
than I thought.

17:32.750 --> 17:34.260
Whatever he wants to do,

17:34.370 --> 17:36.310
he will do it at any cost.

17:37.550 --> 17:38.440
Even if he kills

17:38.440 --> 17:40.620
all the Imperial Guards from before,

17:41.160 --> 17:42.560
what about us?

17:42.590 --> 17:43.310
Isn't he afraid

17:43.310 --> 17:44.070
we'll expose

17:44.070 --> 17:44.850
his regicide?

17:44.850 --> 17:45.390
Exactly.

17:45.570 --> 17:46.480
Who would believe us?

17:46.480 --> 17:47.730
With Weiran's tactics,

17:47.730 --> 17:49.090
he would surely label Yixiao and me

17:49.090 --> 17:49.640
as

17:49.640 --> 17:51.830
traitorous generals who defected to Susha.

17:51.830 --> 17:53.050
You are from Susha.

17:53.430 --> 17:55.030
We, the people of Jinxiu,

17:55.030 --> 17:56.030
naturally trust the Prince of Zhennan
who protects our land

17:56.030 --> 17:56.830
more than you.

17:57.370 --> 17:58.920
Xia Jingshi won't leave.

17:59.400 --> 18:00.460
As you just said,

18:00.570 --> 18:01.880
whatever he wants to do,

18:01.880 --> 18:03.440
he will do it at any cost.

18:03.790 --> 18:05.560
What he wants most right now

18:06.440 --> 18:07.940
is probably to kill me.

18:09.110 --> 18:10.530
As long as I'm still here,

18:11.130 --> 18:12.380
he won't leave.

18:14.130 --> 18:14.720
Your Highness, how could you

18:14.720 --> 18:16.320
stay just to kill Feng Suige?

18:17.480 --> 18:19.190
He destroyed my Yixiao.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.960
I will tear him to pieces.

18:22.390 --> 18:23.250
Your Highness!

18:23.510 --> 18:25.480
The look Yixiao gave me today

18:26.000 --> 18:26.920
was familiar.

18:28.280 --> 18:30.100
That's how she looks at enemies.

18:30.680 --> 18:31.480
Yixiao and I

18:31.480 --> 18:33.200
have faced death together countless times

18:33.200 --> 18:33.960
and trusted each other

18:33.960 --> 18:35.890
with our backs on the battlefield.

18:36.530 --> 18:38.200
Whenever someone hurt me,

18:38.310 --> 18:39.680
Yixiao would give them

18:39.720 --> 18:41.530
a hateful stare.

18:42.080 --> 18:43.160
But today,

18:43.790 --> 18:45.030
I was the one she hated.

18:45.030 --> 18:45.890
Your Highness,

18:46.000 --> 18:46.880
Yixiao has already

18:46.880 --> 18:48.190
become our enemy.

18:48.400 --> 18:48.920
No.

18:49.510 --> 18:50.110
Yixiao has never

18:50.110 --> 18:51.240
been my enemy.

18:51.750 --> 18:53.540
I could have won Yixiao back.

18:53.690 --> 18:54.440
I could have waited

18:54.440 --> 18:55.970
until my plan succeeded

18:56.270 --> 18:57.400
and then told her

18:57.400 --> 18:58.350
why I did everything.

18:58.350 --> 18:58.880
I could have

18:58.880 --> 19:00.030
earned her forgiveness

19:00.030 --> 19:01.630
and had her return to my side.

19:02.750 --> 19:03.830
But Feng Suige...

19:04.510 --> 19:06.050
Feng Suige changed her.

19:07.030 --> 19:08.760
If it weren't for Feng Suige...

19:08.880 --> 19:10.010
Without Feng Suige,

19:10.550 --> 19:11.720
Yixiao wouldn't

19:11.720 --> 19:13.020
be like this now.

19:13.270 --> 19:15.400
Now that my great revenge is complete,

19:15.400 --> 19:16.160
I could have

19:16.160 --> 19:18.000
taken back everything that was mine—

19:18.000 --> 19:20.600
the throne,
the realm, my dignity, my freedom.

19:20.750 --> 19:21.480
But I will never

19:21.480 --> 19:22.640
get Yixiao back.

19:23.440 --> 19:25.300
Yixiao never belonged to anyone.

19:26.750 --> 19:28.260
She belongs to me!

19:35.880 --> 19:37.160
If not for Feng Suige,

19:37.720 --> 19:38.750
no matter what happened

19:38.750 --> 19:39.640
between us,

19:39.640 --> 19:41.240
she would never have left me.

19:41.480 --> 19:42.480
Feng Suige...

19:43.480 --> 19:44.830
I will kill Feng Suige

19:45.400 --> 19:46.880
and win Yixiao back.

19:48.160 --> 19:50.160
Otherwise, what kind of victor am I?

19:51.000 --> 19:52.060
Have you forgotten

19:53.100 --> 19:54.960
how much hardship we've endured,

19:55.270 --> 19:56.550
how much humiliation we've suffered,

19:56.550 --> 19:57.350
and how much blood we've shed

19:57.350 --> 19:58.620
to get here?

20:03.680 --> 20:04.650
I'm begging you,

20:04.830 --> 20:06.160
return to Pingling City

20:06.830 --> 20:08.700
and bring the Zhennan Army back
to reclaim the throne.

20:08.700 --> 20:10.440
We're only one step away from success!

20:10.440 --> 20:12.480
You can wait
until you've secured the throne

20:12.480 --> 20:14.160
before killing Feng Suige.

20:15.640 --> 20:17.570
I will not leave this place either.

20:17.750 --> 20:18.810
He wants to kill me.

20:19.310 --> 20:21.270
And who said I don't want to kill him?

20:21.270 --> 20:23.510
This is my best opportunity.

20:24.030 --> 20:26.030
Once Feng Suige returns to Susha...

20:26.070 --> 20:28.200
Once Xia Jingshi returns to Pingling,

20:28.350 --> 20:29.400
who knows...

20:29.480 --> 20:31.680
When we'll have another chance
to kill him.

20:31.680 --> 20:34.030
But I can't wait even one day.

20:36.830 --> 20:37.690
Your Highness,

20:38.550 --> 20:39.810
please reconsider it.

20:44.160 --> 20:44.880
Weiran,

20:46.140 --> 20:47.560
I've made up my mind.

20:48.400 --> 20:49.530
Go back by yourself.

20:49.920 --> 20:51.050
Go back to Pingling.

20:52.650 --> 20:54.680
If I lose to Feng Suige,

20:56.090 --> 20:57.820
the Zhennan Army will be yours.

20:58.200 --> 20:58.860
I trust you.

20:59.590 --> 21:00.350
With your abilities...

21:00.350 --> 21:01.680
I'm not going anywhere.

21:03.580 --> 21:04.910
Do you think I follow you

21:05.380 --> 21:06.980
for wealth and glory?

21:07.350 --> 21:08.160
Only I know

21:08.160 --> 21:09.620
what you've been through.

21:09.680 --> 21:10.510
Only I

21:11.310 --> 21:12.920
have devoted myself wholeheartedly

21:12.920 --> 21:15.050
to helping you reclaim everything.

21:16.820 --> 21:18.160
I've given up

21:18.160 --> 21:19.400
my two best brothers

21:20.070 --> 21:21.790
and sworn to serve you to the death.

21:21.790 --> 21:23.320
If you're right, I'm right.

21:23.550 --> 21:25.080
If you're wrong, I'm wrong.

21:27.730 --> 21:29.790
But what am I, Xiao Weiran, after all?

21:29.870 --> 21:31.120
Am I a loyal man,

21:32.200 --> 21:33.660
or just blindly obedient?

21:34.640 --> 21:36.750
I've already betrayed my principles.

21:36.750 --> 21:38.150
I cannot be disloyal too.

21:38.880 --> 21:40.540
Since you've decided to stay,

21:41.440 --> 21:42.500
I will stay as well.

21:43.000 --> 21:44.650
Life or death, success or failure—

21:44.650 --> 21:46.110
I will bear it all with you.

21:49.240 --> 21:49.720
Okay.

21:50.400 --> 21:51.650
We will not fail.

21:52.400 --> 21:54.200
We will make sure Feng Suige dies

21:54.440 --> 21:55.920
with no grave to his name.

21:57.550 --> 21:58.410
Your Highness.

21:58.880 --> 21:59.890
I just found out

22:00.000 --> 22:01.210
that Wang Encheng,
the Minister of Revenue,

22:01.210 --> 22:02.750
has somehow obtained information

22:02.750 --> 22:03.550
and spread the news that the Emperor

22:03.550 --> 22:05.120
and the Empress Dowager were dead.

22:05.120 --> 22:06.920
He said they were assassinated.

22:07.050 --> 22:09.770
Now they are searching
the whole city for the culprit.

22:09.770 --> 22:10.790
It must have been Xia Jingshi

22:10.790 --> 22:12.030
who deliberately spread the news.

22:12.030 --> 22:14.510
Xia Jingshi has gone
to the royal ancestral residence.

22:14.510 --> 22:15.180
It's said that

22:15.180 --> 22:15.680
tomorrow he will perform

22:15.680 --> 22:17.230
a ritual to honor the ancestors

22:17.230 --> 22:19.290
as the eldest son of the late emperor.

22:19.530 --> 22:20.990
I know what he's planning.

22:21.110 --> 22:22.580
Xia Jingyan has no heir.

22:22.750 --> 22:23.920
The late emperor only had Xia Jingshi

22:23.920 --> 22:25.270
and Xia Jingyan as sons.

22:25.680 --> 22:27.790
By going to perform
the ancestral rites now,

22:27.790 --> 22:28.440
he intends to

22:28.440 --> 22:29.750
temporarily take control of Jinxiu

22:29.750 --> 22:31.460
as the late emperor's descendant.

22:31.460 --> 22:33.260
But this will invite criticism.

22:33.550 --> 22:35.160
And it's not Xia Jingshi's style.

22:35.160 --> 22:36.360
There must be a trick.

22:36.550 --> 22:37.240
Yu Qi.

22:39.920 --> 22:40.880
Gather all Susha agents

22:40.880 --> 22:42.310
in Shengjing City

22:42.680 --> 22:44.900
to join me in killing Xia Jingshi.

22:45.000 --> 22:45.550
Yes.

22:54.510 --> 22:58.890
[Hidden Dragon Mansion]

23:25.550 --> 23:26.650
[Hidden Dragon Mansion]

23:40.200 --> 23:44.070
Kill!

24:09.240 --> 24:09.800
Kill!

24:23.540 --> 24:24.990
[To Glorify the Past, Enrich the Future]

24:52.590 --> 24:53.630
[To Glorify the Past, Enrich the Future]

24:53.720 --> 24:55.000
Don't harm Yixiao!

25:28.900 --> 25:30.230
Don't blame me, Yixiao.

25:30.680 --> 25:32.540
I can't let you stop His Highness!

25:38.350 --> 25:39.240
Feng Suige.

25:40.200 --> 25:41.660
I've been waiting for you.

25:42.310 --> 25:44.430
You revealed your location on purpose

25:44.430 --> 25:46.560
just to issue a challenge, didn't you?

25:46.880 --> 25:47.800
You know

25:47.920 --> 25:49.500
I'd come

25:48.140 --> 25:51.150
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

25:49.680 --> 25:51.240
even if it's the tiger's den,

25:51.240 --> 25:53.160
because I'm determined

25:53.160 --> 25:54.830
to take your head myself.

25:55.920 --> 25:58.400
This is the ancestral home
of the Jinxiu royal family.

25:58.400 --> 26:01.740
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

25:58.590 --> 26:00.730
Ancestors watching from Heaven,

26:01.030 --> 26:02.830
everything I've done

26:02.880 --> 26:04.120
was for Jinxiu.

26:04.260 --> 26:07.220
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

26:04.830 --> 26:06.790
I have no shame before my ancestors.

26:06.790 --> 26:07.350
Today,

26:07.880 --> 26:08.960
I will kill you

26:08.960 --> 26:10.360
in front of my ancestors.

26:10.400 --> 26:12.240
When you secretly colluded with the enemy,

26:12.240 --> 26:13.790
and when you repaid kindness with betrayal

26:13.790 --> 26:15.680
as Susha's Prince Consort,

26:16.070 --> 26:17.270
did you ever think

26:17.270 --> 26:19.000
how you'd face your ancestors?

26:22.600 --> 26:23.200
Kill!

26:47.710 --> 26:48.860
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

26:58.250 --> 26:58.940
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

27:31.920 --> 27:33.280
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

29:34.320 --> 29:35.250
How could you...

29:36.240 --> 29:37.350
How could you

29:37.370 --> 29:39.200
really try to kill Yixiao?

29:41.440 --> 29:43.040
She's your brother, Weiran.

29:49.280 --> 29:50.970
Heaven has been kind to me.

29:53.030 --> 29:54.440
Dying at your hands

29:55.640 --> 29:56.300
is worth it.

30:02.350 --> 30:02.920
Weiran.

30:05.490 --> 30:06.470
In this life,

30:07.780 --> 30:09.910
I lost the chance to turn back long ago.

30:12.250 --> 30:13.580
If there's a next life,

30:16.310 --> 30:17.400
I hope you

30:18.330 --> 30:19.350
won't despise me

30:21.090 --> 30:23.090
and still accept me as your brother.

31:13.850 --> 31:14.640
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

31:27.290 --> 31:29.560
[To Glorify the Past, Enrich the Future]

32:05.590 --> 32:06.740
This stab...

32:08.110 --> 32:10.030
is for Xiyang.

32:14.650 --> 32:15.360
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

32:23.290 --> 32:26.290
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

32:25.310 --> 32:26.200
You got hurt.

32:27.310 --> 32:28.110
It's nothing.

32:30.240 --> 32:31.100
I didn't expect

32:32.150 --> 32:33.550
you would really kill me.

32:34.230 --> 32:35.890
I've returned to you the arrow

32:35.960 --> 32:37.020
you once shot at me.

32:38.310 --> 32:39.310
In my life,

32:40.640 --> 32:41.910
my only mistake

32:42.640 --> 32:44.640
was shooting that arrow at you.

32:44.820 --> 32:46.260
I used to think

32:47.110 --> 32:48.550
that seizing the throne

32:48.550 --> 32:50.050
was the most important thing to me.

32:50.050 --> 32:51.110
But when I saw you

32:51.110 --> 32:52.860
fall off that cliff,

32:54.440 --> 32:55.400
I realized

32:58.280 --> 33:00.500
you were the most important to me.

33:45.580 --> 33:48.590
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

33:51.110 --> 33:51.970
Your Highness.

33:52.030 --> 33:53.830
We've killed everyone outside.

33:54.240 --> 33:55.440
What shall we do next?

34:00.070 --> 34:00.890
Let's go home.

34:01.850 --> 34:05.370
[Yujing City, Susha Kingdom]

34:24.760 --> 34:26.489
Greetings, Your Majesty.

34:27.230 --> 34:27.960
His Majesty sent me

34:27.960 --> 34:29.420
to inform you

34:29.550 --> 34:31.760
that the First Prince will soon return
to Yujing to ascend the throne.

34:31.760 --> 34:33.870
His Majesty wishes for you
to go to the imperial tomb

34:33.870 --> 34:35.400
to accompany the late emperor.

34:35.400 --> 34:37.730
Your Majesty, please make preparations.

34:39.550 --> 34:40.940
I've brought some palace maids

34:40.940 --> 34:42.380
to help you get ready

34:42.500 --> 34:43.540
and pack your

34:43.560 --> 34:45.100
personal clothes

34:45.230 --> 34:46.560
and daily necessities.

34:55.560 --> 34:56.830
Get out of here!

35:06.610 --> 35:07.280
Out!

35:29.000 --> 35:30.410
Wei Qingyu...

35:31.000 --> 35:32.960
in the end, you won.

35:39.240 --> 35:40.470
Feng Pingcheng,

35:42.080 --> 35:44.240
you've deceived me your entire life.

35:44.440 --> 35:46.850
And now you want me to accompany you?

35:49.400 --> 35:50.760
Dream on!

36:01.030 --> 36:04.690
[Shousheng Palace]

36:07.820 --> 36:08.880
Where is the Empress Dowager?

36:08.880 --> 36:09.890
Is she ready?

36:10.330 --> 36:11.600
Her Majesty...

36:13.280 --> 36:14.070
Your Majesty,

36:14.070 --> 36:14.710
Her Majesty

36:14.710 --> 36:15.960
has driven us all out.

36:16.280 --> 36:18.010
She's been alone in there for a long time.

36:18.010 --> 36:19.300
[Shousheng Palace]

36:29.710 --> 36:30.350
Mother,

36:30.760 --> 36:31.670
are you ready?

36:38.590 --> 36:41.670
[Shousheng Palace]

37:18.490 --> 37:19.180
Mother!

37:20.890 --> 37:21.520
Mother!

37:25.160 --> 37:26.000
Mother!

37:28.030 --> 37:28.960
Mother!

37:29.320 --> 37:30.280
Mother!

38:01.130 --> 38:10.970
[Wutong Mansion]

38:02.070 --> 38:03.670
Come, pour wine for me.

38:04.000 --> 38:04.750
Fill my cup.

38:04.880 --> 38:05.880
Let me tell you...

38:06.590 --> 38:07.490
Commander Lu.

38:07.880 --> 38:10.000
The heroine Fu Yixiao

38:10.510 --> 38:12.670
and Feng Suige, the Killer God of Susha—

38:12.670 --> 38:13.520
they

38:13.630 --> 38:16.490
worked together
to end the war between two nations.

38:16.960 --> 38:19.120
When the new Emperor of Jinxiu
ascended the throne,

38:19.120 --> 38:21.630
he wanted to title Fu Yixiao
as King of Pingling,

38:21.630 --> 38:23.290
commanding the Zhennan Army.

38:24.320 --> 38:25.610
Guess what happened?

38:25.890 --> 38:27.750
-What happened?
-What happened?

38:27.960 --> 38:29.260
Fu Yixiao

38:29.400 --> 38:30.630
refused the title.

38:30.920 --> 38:33.320
She asked the Emperor
to use all the rewards

38:33.320 --> 38:35.000
to help those in need.

38:35.030 --> 38:36.710
Such courage, such vision—

38:36.730 --> 38:37.790
are you impressed?

38:37.880 --> 38:39.400
Yes!

38:39.400 --> 38:39.920
So impressed!

38:39.920 --> 38:41.780
I'm impressed too. Come, cheers!

38:43.000 --> 38:44.630
Well, well, well. Who's back?

38:44.630 --> 38:46.220
General Lu!

38:46.840 --> 38:48.110
You truly deserve the title

38:48.110 --> 38:49.860
of Grand Commander of our Imperial Guards.

38:49.860 --> 38:51.270
You look full of energy.

38:52.230 --> 38:53.560
Are you on duty tonight?

38:54.030 --> 38:55.570
Then you can't drink.

38:56.800 --> 38:57.550
Really?

38:57.630 --> 38:58.320
Not even one cup?

38:58.320 --> 38:58.990
Yun Qing.

38:59.320 --> 39:00.760
He has his duties.

39:01.480 --> 39:03.400
Don't make such a fuss
about it in the future.

39:03.400 --> 39:04.000
Alright.

39:04.190 --> 39:04.880
Indeed.

39:05.870 --> 39:07.110
I'm a third-rank official

39:07.110 --> 39:08.190
with important responsibilities.

39:08.190 --> 39:09.070
My brother was promoted to a commander

39:09.070 --> 39:10.310
in the Feng Battalion—

39:10.310 --> 39:11.310
also third-rank.

39:11.670 --> 39:12.190
Yes.

39:12.350 --> 39:13.320
I heard about it.

39:13.710 --> 39:14.550
No wonder I think

39:14.550 --> 39:15.370
His Highness

39:15.400 --> 39:16.710
is brilliant most of the time,
but sometimes clueless.

39:16.710 --> 39:17.230
You brat,

39:17.230 --> 39:19.110
how did you manage to become a commander?

39:19.110 --> 39:19.820
You brat.

39:19.960 --> 39:21.400
I praised you a bit
and you started showing off again,

39:21.400 --> 39:21.960
huh?

39:22.030 --> 39:23.190
I don't care if you're on duty or not.

39:23.190 --> 39:23.800
Tonight,

39:23.800 --> 39:25.000
I'd like to see who gets drunk first.

39:25.000 --> 39:25.530
Let's go.

39:26.550 --> 39:27.150
I quit drinking

39:27.150 --> 39:28.150
after the celebration banquet

39:28.150 --> 39:29.410
at the Storm Alliance.

39:31.440 --> 39:31.800
Oh, right.

39:31.800 --> 39:32.750
Save your appetite and eat more meat—

39:32.750 --> 39:33.960
that's better than anything.

39:33.960 --> 39:34.440
Yes.

39:34.800 --> 39:35.150
Yes.

39:35.360 --> 39:35.710
Yes.

39:39.320 --> 39:40.110
Ning Fei, you're here?

39:40.110 --> 39:41.070
Hurry up and join us for a drink.

39:41.070 --> 39:41.710
Have a drink with us.

39:41.710 --> 39:42.170
Come on!

39:43.360 --> 39:44.320
Maybe next time.

39:44.920 --> 39:45.630
I've just rushed back

39:45.630 --> 39:46.510
from the Storm Alliance day and night

39:46.510 --> 39:47.440
so as not to delay

39:47.480 --> 39:48.360
what your boss and Yixiao

39:48.360 --> 39:49.740
entrusted to me.

39:49.840 --> 39:50.400
You

39:50.480 --> 39:51.510
must be eager to reunite

39:51.510 --> 39:52.510
with Young Mistress Ling.

39:52.510 --> 39:53.000
See?

39:53.850 --> 39:54.710
I am. So what?

39:55.110 --> 39:55.510
You

39:55.530 --> 39:57.000
can just keep being jealous.

39:57.000 --> 39:57.660
Look at him.

39:57.750 --> 39:58.960
I have something to talk to you.

39:58.960 --> 40:00.070
Have you relayed to Elder Lei

40:00.070 --> 40:01.510
what His Highness asked you to?

40:01.510 --> 40:02.110
Of course.

40:02.550 --> 40:03.430
I told them that

40:03.550 --> 40:04.880
it was the Kui Battalion of Susha

40:04.880 --> 40:06.320
who hunted the Storm Alliance back then.

40:06.320 --> 40:07.440
It was an order from Zhuang Shen.

40:07.440 --> 40:08.770
The evidence is ironclad.

40:08.770 --> 40:09.250
Right.

40:09.710 --> 40:10.840
When Elder Zhang heard that Feng Suige

40:10.840 --> 40:11.850
helped them take revenge,

40:11.850 --> 40:13.000
she said she'd thank him in person

40:13.000 --> 40:14.110
if she had the chance.

40:14.110 --> 40:14.780
Really?

40:15.000 --> 40:16.000
That's good then.

40:16.040 --> 40:16.960
Then the matter with the Storm Alliance

40:16.960 --> 40:17.800
is over now,

40:17.920 --> 40:18.840
and the grudge of Elder Lei and the others

40:18.840 --> 40:19.630
has finally been resolved.

40:19.630 --> 40:20.110
I...

40:20.550 --> 40:21.760
Look how eager you are.

40:21.760 --> 40:22.190
Alright.

40:22.190 --> 40:22.960
I'll help you pass this news

40:22.960 --> 40:24.190
on to His Highness.

40:24.210 --> 40:25.570
Hurry up and go now.

40:25.630 --> 40:26.890
Look how eager you are.

40:27.000 --> 40:27.800
Thank you.

40:28.840 --> 40:30.170
Give my regards to them.

40:30.360 --> 40:30.590
Sure.

40:30.590 --> 40:31.210
Right?

40:31.320 --> 40:32.920
While I've been away these days,

40:32.920 --> 40:34.000
Xueying is taking care of 3 children
alone.

40:34.000 --> 40:34.880
You even have children now?

40:34.880 --> 40:35.510
Three?

40:35.510 --> 40:36.510
Don't talk nonsense.

40:36.510 --> 40:37.440
They're not our children.

40:37.440 --> 40:38.710
Alright, alright. You'd better go now.

40:38.710 --> 40:40.710
If you're late, you won't even be able
to enter your mansion.

40:40.710 --> 40:41.230
Alright.

40:41.230 --> 40:42.020
I'll be going then.

40:42.020 --> 40:42.420
Go.

40:42.550 --> 40:43.010
Wait...

40:43.030 --> 40:44.030
Ning Fei, hold on.

40:45.670 --> 40:46.400
Miss Yixiao

40:46.630 --> 40:47.670
specially asked me

40:47.670 --> 40:48.880
to prepare this for you.

40:48.880 --> 40:49.400
Inside,

40:49.400 --> 40:50.840
there's braised meat and wine,

40:50.840 --> 40:52.670
and candies and preserves

40:52.670 --> 40:54.110
that Nine, Fang, and Shunzi like.

40:54.110 --> 40:55.000
Since you're out here,

40:55.000 --> 40:56.600
don't go back empty-handed.

40:57.520 --> 40:58.450
Where is Yixiao?

40:59.360 --> 41:01.520
Do you even need to ask?

41:01.710 --> 41:02.840
She's surely...

41:02.880 --> 41:05.140
Reuniting with His Highness.

41:26.320 --> 41:27.920
What are you thinking about?

41:28.230 --> 41:29.510
The bustle of the world

41:30.360 --> 41:31.510
and its splendor.

41:35.190 --> 41:35.710
To you.

41:37.210 --> 41:37.810
Why?

41:38.110 --> 41:39.170
Jinxiu is in chaos,

41:39.530 --> 41:41.670
with a weak prince ascending the throne.

41:41.670 --> 41:42.280
It should have been

41:42.280 --> 41:44.710
the perfect chance for you
to attack Jinxiu.

41:44.710 --> 41:45.440
But you agreed

41:45.440 --> 41:46.460
with Jinxiu

41:46.550 --> 41:48.280
that for ten years neither side

41:48.590 --> 41:50.050
would attack so the people

41:50.070 --> 41:51.800
could recover.

41:52.440 --> 41:53.640
I should toast to you.

41:54.920 --> 41:56.520
The novel Pei wrote about you

41:57.070 --> 41:58.530
is selling like hotcakes.

41:58.800 --> 42:00.480
The story of the heroine Fu Yixiao

42:00.480 --> 42:02.010
has spread across the land.

42:02.110 --> 42:02.800
Who doesn't know

42:02.800 --> 42:04.130
how much you sacrificed

42:04.760 --> 42:05.800
for this peace?

42:06.590 --> 42:08.590
Do you really not want to be emperor?

42:09.030 --> 42:09.670
Chengyang has gone to Youqi Temple

42:09.670 --> 42:10.920
to live in seclusion.

42:11.360 --> 42:13.320
He wanted to return the throne to you,

42:13.320 --> 42:14.130
but you refused it.

42:14.130 --> 42:15.860
Things are fine as they are now.

42:15.940 --> 42:16.760
I want to wait 3 years

42:16.760 --> 42:18.480
until the mourning period ends

42:18.480 --> 42:20.340
before deciding the succession;

42:20.470 --> 42:22.960
in the meantime Xiyang
will handle state affairs.

42:22.960 --> 42:24.240
Xiyang was previously

42:24.440 --> 42:25.640
in complete despair.

42:26.190 --> 42:27.630
Now, focusing on governance

42:27.630 --> 42:28.740
and the people

42:29.030 --> 42:29.920
is good for her

42:30.000 --> 42:31.130
and for Susha.

42:34.510 --> 42:35.670
If, after 3 years,

42:36.110 --> 42:37.230
she likes it

42:38.160 --> 42:39.290
and rules well,

42:40.210 --> 42:41.740
I'll let her be the empress.

42:44.330 --> 42:45.900
When the three-year mourning period ends,

42:44.640 --> 42:47.700
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

42:46.280 --> 42:47.360
I will give you

42:47.880 --> 42:49.810
the grandest wedding in the world.

42:50.990 --> 42:52.240
I have a gift

42:51.350 --> 42:54.030
♪ Time is unbearable to endure ♪

42:52.870 --> 42:53.990
that I want to give you.

42:53.990 --> 42:55.100
Is this gift

42:54.500 --> 42:57.480
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

42:55.480 --> 42:57.440
Susha's First Prince

42:57.840 --> 43:00.210
or the Regent?

42:58.030 --> 43:00.470
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

43:01.060 --> 43:03.740
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

43:01.710 --> 43:03.300
I am entirely yours;

43:03.480 --> 43:04.400
that's not a gift.

43:04.220 --> 43:06.870
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪

43:05.710 --> 43:07.740
I will give you the greatest divine bow
in the world,

43:07.490 --> 43:10.330
♪ The phoenix going against light ♪

43:08.190 --> 43:09.120
the Zhuixia Bow.

43:10.470 --> 43:11.030
My wife

43:10.760 --> 43:13.230
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

43:11.030 --> 43:12.890
is the world's greatest archer.

43:13.110 --> 43:13.880
Of course she should have

43:13.880 --> 43:15.000
the world's finest bow.

43:14.010 --> 43:16.760
♪ As years pass, dust stirs,
stirring deep longing ♪

43:16.280 --> 43:17.860
Then I shall treasure it dearly.

43:17.330 --> 43:22.360
♪ All I ask is to be together forever ♪

43:18.880 --> 43:20.610
I hope I'll never need to use it.

43:21.670 --> 43:22.480
I wish for

43:22.800 --> 43:24.060
peace and prosperity,

43:24.320 --> 43:25.920
with no disasters or troubles,

43:25.920 --> 43:26.510
so I never need to face

43:26.510 --> 43:27.670
an enemy again.

43:27.160 --> 43:29.710
♪ You and I silently recite ♪

43:28.670 --> 43:30.730
The only person I need to deal with now

43:30.920 --> 43:31.800
is you.

43:32.710 --> 43:33.360
However,

43:33.680 --> 43:36.040
♪ This love will never perish ♪

43:33.920 --> 43:35.780
I don't need a bow to deal with you.

43:36.000 --> 43:37.230
If you don't behave,

43:37.840 --> 43:38.960
I'll use

43:39.190 --> 43:40.440
a feather duster.

43:40.000 --> 43:42.180
♪ I search for you, yet cannot find you ♪
